    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSet in the much sought after Castle Grove development, Sherry FitzGerald O'Donovan are delighted to present No. 11A to the market.\n\nCastle Grove is a low density mature development of only 36 detached homes situated only 500m from Mallow town centre. Set back off St. Josephs Road and approached by a mature tree lined avenue, it is a private and quiet development where it is seldom homes come to the market.\n\nThis stunning four-bedroom property offers bright, spacious and well-maintained accommodation throughout, making it an ideal family home. The property features four generous bedrooms with a spacious master bedroom complete with a private en-suite and walk-in wardrobe. The home also benefits from two generous reception rooms, a fully fitted kitchen, utility and a convenient downstairs WC.\n\nTo the rear and side, the property benefits from a lovely private garden, providing an excellent outdoor space for relaxing and entertaining. Having been carefully maintained by its previous owners, this impressive home is ready for its new owners to enjoy.\n\nA viewing comes highly recommended and by appointment only with sole selling agents Sherry FitzGerald O'Donovan."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nLaminate flooring, Recessed lighting\n\nSitting Room - \nCarpet, Feature fireplace with Gas insert.\n\nLiving Room - \nLaminate flooring, Solid fuel fire, Double doors to kitchen dining.\n\nKitchen - \nTiled flooring, Recessesd lighting, Fully Fitted kitchen, Intergrated hob and double oven, Sliding door\n\nUtility Room - \nTiled flooring, Fitted units, Plumbed for washing and drying, Door to Rear.\n\nBedroom 1 - \nCarpet\n\nShower room - \nFully tiled, WHB, Toilet and Shower not electric\n\nLanding - \nSolid wood flooring, Hot press\n\nMaster Bedroom - \nTimber Flooring\n\nWalk in Robe - \nTimber flooring, Fitted Rail and shelving.\n\nEn-Suite - \nFully Tiled, WHB, Toilet\n\nBedroom 2 - \nTimber flooring\n\nBedroom 3 - \nTimber flooring\n\nBathroom - \nFully tiled, Bath with shower, WHB and toilet\n\n"
      },
      {
